  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "As the emperor falls into critical condition, senior police Officers order a sweeping crackdown across Tokyo before the imperial era changes and warn detective Takei that corrupt officers will be swept out too. Listen for \"torishimari\", law-enforcement crackdown.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "元号の改元に伴い、取り締まりの強化を図る予定です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "まもなく時代が変わる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "国民の安全を実現するために、一斉検挙を着実に推進してもらいたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "その日が来たら一週間はバラエティ番組の放送を見送らせる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "都内の清掃作業を一斉に行う。一気に取りかかれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "はい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "気をつけ！敬礼！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "武井、お前の縄張りも整理しろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "きれいに整理してますよ、俺んとこは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "下手するとお前も掃除されるぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "チッ、冗談じゃねえぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "一斉摘発をする方針を発表いたしました。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "元号の改元に伴い、取り締まりの強化を図る予定です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ahead of the change of imperial era, we plan to intensify law enforcement.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "まもなく時代が変わる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Very soon, the era itself will change.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "国民の安全を実現するために、一斉検挙を着実に推進してもらいたい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To secure public safety, carry out simultaneous mass arrests steadily.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "その日が来たら一週間はバラエティ番組の放送を見送らせる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When that day arrives, networks will suspend variety broadcasts for one week.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "都内の清掃作業を一斉に行う。一気に取りかかれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will sweep Tokyo clean all at once. Get started immediately.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "はい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, sir!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "気をつけ！敬礼！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Attention! Salute!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "武井、お前の縄張りも整理しろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Takei, clean up your own territory too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "きれいに整理してますよ、俺んとこは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My turf is already neatly tidied up, sir.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "下手するとお前も掃除されるぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Make one misstep and you will get swept away yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "チッ、冗談じゃねえぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tch, give me a break.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "一斉摘発をする方針を発表いたしました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Authorities announced a policy of simultaneous nationwide raids.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
